<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ says Sept year underlying inflation 2.34 pct.</title>
<headline>RBNZ says Sept year underlying inflation 2.34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Tuesday that underlying inflation for the September 1996 quarter was 0.33 percent, making 2.34 percent for the year.</p>
</text>
